WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:05.760
San Diego Comic-Con 2019 has brought big news
for fans of the greenest girl in the Marvel

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:07.020
Cinematic Universe.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:11.400
Thanks to a panel discussion with Avengers:
Endgame writers Christopher Markus and Stephen

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:16.690
McFeely, as well as directors Joe and Anthony
Russo, we finally have an answer to a huge

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:21.740
question about the post-Endgame fate of Gamora,
a fan-favorite member of the Guardians of

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:22.460
the Galaxy.

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:26.080
Of course, some questions will always remain
unanswered.

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:27.980
"Why is Gamora?!"

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:33.320
According to Vanity Fair, Markus and McFeely
revealed that Zoe Saldana's alien assassin

00:00:33.329 --> 00:00:37.579
is indeed alive and well in the aftermath
of Tony Stark's momentous snap at the end

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:42.880
of Endgame the one that completely took out
Thanos' army of evildoers and creepy creatures.

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:48.020
Some fans were concerned that they may have
permanently lost Gamora to Tony's snap, considering

00:00:48.039 --> 00:00:53.089
that, thanks to some time-travel antics, Avengers:
Endgame featured a past version of Gamora

00:00:53.089 --> 00:00:55.820
who was still working with her adoptive father,
Thanos.

00:00:55.960 --> 00:01:01.160
Marvel fans don't need to be reminded of present-day
Gamora's emotional death in Avengers: Infinity

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:06.329
War, where Thanos sacrificed her to snag the
Soul Stone and power his Infinity Gauntlet

00:01:06.329 --> 00:01:08.260
during his quest for universal domination.

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:13.700
Watching her lose her life in Infinity War
was difficult and thinking that past Gamora

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:17.900
was a goner as well after the events of Endgame
was even more devastating to consider.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:22.950
Ever since her first appearance in Guardians
of the Galaxy, Saldana's Gamora has charmed

00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:28.409
audiences thanks to her intense fighting prowess,
her sharp wit and intelligence, and, of course,

00:01:28.409 --> 00:01:30.680
her romantic entanglement with Peter Quill.

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:32.700
"There's another name you might know me by...

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:35.700
Star-Lord."

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:37.960
"Who?"

00:01:38.180 --> 00:01:42.840
However, Star-Lord's fury over his fallen
love is one of the factors that led to Thanos'

00:01:42.840 --> 00:01:46.020
"Snappening" at the close of Infinity War
in the first place.

00:01:46.360 --> 00:01:51.100
When Quill emotionally attacked Thanos after
learning the news of Gamora's death, it gave

00:01:51.109 --> 00:01:55.810
the supervillain the opportunity to overpower
the Avengers and ultimately snap away half

00:01:55.810 --> 00:01:58.380
of all life across the entire universe.

00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:04.299
Five years after Thanos' fateful Decimation,
the Avengers reunited in Endgame to attempt

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:08.560
a "time heist" in hopes of saving all of their
vanished friends and loved ones.

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:13.920
Despite several mishaps, it ended up working
out but one surprise guest returned along

00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:16.240
with everyone else who was originally dusted.

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:22.400
When Thanos shot his army from 2014 into the
MCU's present, Gamora was suddenly back in

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:24.060
play, with a big catch.

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:30.319
This wasn't the version of Gamora that died
in Infinity War; rather, it was the 2014 Gamora

00:02:30.320 --> 00:02:32.540
who was still firmly on her dad's side.

00:02:32.860 --> 00:02:38.480
For this reason, fans debated whether or not
Gamora was spared during Tony Stark's sacrificial

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:40.660
snap during Endgame's big battle scene.

00:02:41.049 --> 00:02:44.760
Even though it was possible that Tony's snap
didn't dust her and that she was still around

00:02:44.769 --> 00:02:49.280
somewhere, Gamora didn't show up on Star-Lord's
radar when he went searching for her in the

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:50.560
final moments of Endgame.

00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:56.520
The argument was still raging in May of 2019,
when the creative team behind Avengers: Endgame

00:02:56.520 --> 00:03:00.500
simply stoked the flames by saying that Gamora's
fate could go either way.

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:05.560
During a chat with Business Insider, the Russos
said that Gamora may have been dusted, but

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:08.260
it was also possible that she survived the
snap.

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:12.260
They then stated that fans would just have
to wait until Guardians of the Galaxy Vol.

00:03:12.260 --> 00:03:14.520
3 arrives in theaters to see for themselves.

00:03:14.810 --> 00:03:19.320
To make matters more stressful, the Russos
also said Quill, who was looking for Gamora

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:22.700
at the end of Endgame, didn't know what had
happened to her either.

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:27.360
At that time, the Russo Brothers seemed happy
to put the burden of this particular reveal

00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:32.290
on James Gunn, who is returning as the writer
and director of the third Guardians movie

00:03:32.290 --> 00:03:36.000
but thankfully they've changed their tune
and revealed the truth ahead of schedule.

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:42.300
However, now that we know for sure that Gamora
is alive, there are still some obvious complications:

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:47.440
since she's the 2014 Gamora, she doesn't know
anything about the Avengers, and doesn't really

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:51.820
know who Peter Quill even is, which could
present some pretty awkward problems.

00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:56.700
She and her sister Nebula could also still
potentially be at odds, despite the friendship

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:59.040
they forged throughout their previous adventures
together.

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:04.300
Saldana hasn't officially confirmed her return
in Guardians 3, but she did recently say that

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:08.959
she would love to play a more villainous version
of her signature Marvel character in the upcoming

00:04:08.959 --> 00:04:13.800
sequel, so it stands to reason that Gamora
would be included in the final film of this

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:16.180
whimsical, irreverent film trilogy.

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:20.620
And since she was also one of the stars who
petitioned to reinstate Gunn after old tweets

00:04:20.620 --> 00:04:25.060
initially got him fired from the third Guardians
film, the idea of Gunn not being behind the

00:04:25.060 --> 00:04:27.800
camera is no longer standing in the way of
her returning.

00:04:28.130 --> 00:04:33.040
For now, it remains to be seen just what type
of role Gamora will play in upcoming Marvel

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:37.750
films, but at the very least, it's comforting
to know that the MCU's favorite verdant warrior

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:40.920
is still out there somewhere, planning her
next move.

